    "answer": {
      "short": "C: $33$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3M^2+5M}{6}&=\\frac{3(-9)^2+5(-9)}{6}\\\\\\frac{3M^2+5M}{6}&=\\frac{243+(-45)}{6}\\\\\\frac{3M^2+5M}{6}&=\\frac{198}{6}\\\\\\frac{3M^2+5M}{6}&=33\\end{align*}$$\nCorrect answer: C.",
